  "description": "Bring the warmth of the season to your creative projects with Harvest Whispers, a charming hand painted fall clipart collection filled with nostalgic autumn details. This autumn harvest watercolor PNG set features pumpkins, fall leaves, florals, figs, pears, acorns, bows, woodland-inspired elements, wreaths and more in a soft grandmillennial cottagecore palette.\nYou’ll receive 92 individual high-resolution PNG elements with transparent backgrounds, plus 4 coordinating JPEG seamless patterns, perfect for fall invitations, Thanksgiving stationery, greeting cards, stickers, scrapbooking, packaging, branding, sublimation, printable projects and seasonal designs.\nThe warm watercolor textures and timeless harvest palette make these fall PNG graphics especially lovely for Thanksgiving designs, autumn wedding stationery, cottagecore projects and cozy seasonal branding.\nInstant digital download — create beautiful autumn designs by mixing, layering and arranging the individual elements in your own unique way.projects.\n♡What is included:\n92 high-resolution illustrations with transparent background | .png\n4 seamless patterns sized 12” x 12” | 3600×3600 at 300 dpi | .jpeg",
